  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO, Covid response plan in ethiopia World Health Organization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The C-19 Response plan, funded through the WHO, aims to support the Government of Ethiopia&#x2019;s pandemic response, slowing down C-19 transmission and reducing associated mortality. Key activities include advocacy for a multi-sector C-19 response, strengthening surveillance &amp; laboratory capacity, supporting readiness and response measures, setting up of triage centres in health facilities and integration of the C-19 response into the routine health care system.</narrative>
  </description>
